      "durationSeconds": 6.84,
      "pitchSemitones": 1,
      "pitchChoice": "B"
    },
    {
      "key": "guideGeneral",
      "text": "では、総務担当者へのお取り次ぎで承ります。",
      "sha256": "2ae08d42309dc4fd5fbb50c644c172136ac872efbce466a4f5f5a3a0d6190332",
      "bytes": 178604,
      "sourceSHA256": "6d3c9ac65ad9fcde9cd0a92e9961b6c46f7c3782c9c3fbfc54bf190854a1a059",
      "audio": "./leda-audio-b/guideGeneral.wav?v=20261021-leda-pitch-b-1",
      "durationSeconds": 3.72,
      "pitchSemitones": 1,
      "pitchChoice": "B"
    },
    {
      "key": "guideUnclear",
      "text": "すみません、番号を一つに絞れませんでした。画面の番号を、もう一度お答えください。",
